# 22 -- DM_REAM refit potential with the zero-referenced embedding (EMBF0).
#
# ta2_refit_seed.tadah is a `tadah refit` of the Ta2 EAM (see README.md). Every
# linear coefficient is pinned (FIXINDEX/FIXWEIGHT), so the run needs no
# training data and no --validation: the loss is the LAMMPS cohesive energy.
#
# The search moves the two NEGATIVE embedding knots (CEMBFUNC 1 and 4) --
# exactly the parameters that change the raw F(0) = sum_m w_m g_m(0). Under
# EMBF0 ZERO (the seed declares it) every candidate's DM_REAM subtracts its
# own g_m(0), so the isolated-atom energy Eiso (read back from Ecoh.in) is
# exactly 0 for EVERY evaluation; run.sh asserts it.

OPTIMIZER
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PLAIN
    LIB NLOPT
    ALGO LN_SBPLX
    MAXEVAL 20
    STEP 0.2
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_LAMMPS --script ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in --hotvar hot_a0 2.5 4.5 3.304 --varloss Ecoh 8.10 800 --outvar Eiso

OPTIM CEMBFUNC (1) -2.19 -2.15
OPTIM CEMBFUNC (4) -0.1665 -0.1630

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
